<view class="page"><view class="title">先见一面，再认真决定</view><view class="subtitle">为这一次到店，留一点准备时间。</view><view class="spacer"/><load-state loading="{{loading}}" error="{{error}}" bind:retry="reload"/><block wx:if="{{shop}}"><view class="panel"><view class="heading">⌖ {{shop.name}}</view><view class="spacer"/><view>{{shop.address}}</view><view class="caption">{{shop.businessHours}}</view><view class="brand small" wx:if="{{demo}}">虚构地址，仅供练习</view></view><view class="panel"><view class="heading">到店前的小准备</view><view class="spacer"/><view class="pre">{{shop.pickupInstructions}}</view><view class="caption">请先等待门店确认预约，并按约定时间到店。</view></view><button class="btn secondary" wx:if="{{shop.phone}}" bindtap="phone">拨打门店电话</button><button class="text-btn" wx:if="{{shop.wechat}}" bindtap="wechat">复制门店微信号</button><button class="btn secondary" wx:if="{{hasMap}}" bindtap="map">打开地图导航</button><view class="notice neutral">线上仅安排到店预约，不收款。</view><view class="demo-note">灵宠小珠 · {{demo ? '本地演示' : '练习项目'}}</view></block></view>
